{"title":"Easter Basket","slug":"Easter_Basket","hero":{"file":"Easter_Basket.webp","width":292,"height":342},"pageid":1508,"revid":21263,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T06:10:55Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":["Items","Limited","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Price","value":"🥚17"},{"label":"Function","value":"Hold 10 Scattered Eggs"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.5.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"09/04/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"<b>Collect those eggs in style! Use this basket to hold up to 10 eggs!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Easter basket</b> was available for <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>17 during the Easter Event. It was used to collect 10 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Scattered_Eggs/\">Scattered Eggs</a> at once.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.5.0/\">Version 1.5.0</a>, on the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggtastic Hop Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>The mechanics have been completely redesigned;\n<ul><li>The <b>Easter basket</b> can now collect 10 <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Scattered_Eggs/\">Scattered Eggs</a> at once instead of doubling the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">Eggs</a>;</li></ul></li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>125 to $1,600;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $1,600 to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>17.</li></ul>"}
